{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测Windows全系统启用用户态完整转储。对应需求：凭据访问。官方：Full User-Mode Dumps Enabled System-Wide。","from":"now-9m","index":["winlogbeat-*","logs-endpoint.events.registry-*","logs-windows.sysmon_operational-*","endgame-*","logs-m365_defender.event-*"],"language":"eql","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】Windows全系统启用用户态完整转储","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nWindows全系统启用用户态完整转储\n\n### 为何重要\n窃取或中继域与本机凭据\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对进程名、命令行、父进程、用户与事件ID。\n2. 核对路径、注册表、外连地址与是否符合变更窗口。\n3. 关联同主机前后同类告警、落地文件与凭据操作。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、软件分发或安全工具\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离主机、终止可疑进程并排查落地文件与账号。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警与外连。\n","references":["https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/win32/wer/collecting-user-mode-dumps","https://github.com/deepinstinct/Lsass-Shtinkering","https://media.defcon.org/DEF%20CON%2030/DEF%20CON%2030%20presentations/Asaf%20Gilboa%20-%20LSASS%20Shtinkering%20Abusing%20Windows%20Error%20Reporting%20to%20Dump%20LSASS.pdf"],"risk_score":47,"rule_id":"220be143-5c67-4fdb-b6ce-dd6826d024fd","severity":"medium","tags":["操作系统: Windows","主题: 凭据访问","来源: 默认","对应需求: 凭据访问"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"eql","query":"registry where host.os.type == \"windows\" and\n    registry.path : (\n        \"HKLM\\\\SOFTWARE\\\\Microsoft\\\\Windows\\\\Windows Error Reporting\\\\LocalDumps\\\\DumpType\",\n        \"\\\\REGISTRY\\\\MACHINE\\\\SOFTWARE\\\\Microsoft\\\\Windows\\\\Windows Error Reporting\\\\LocalDumps\\\\DumpType\"\n    ) and\n    registry.data.strings : (\"2\", \"0x00000002\") and\n    not (process.executable : \"?:\\\\Windows\\\\system32\\\\svchost.exe\" and user.id : (\"S-1-5-18\", \"S-1-5-19\", \"S-1-5-20\"))\n","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标 Windows 主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**（按规则需要进程/网络/文件/注册表或安全日志）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1003","name":"OS Credential Dumping","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1003/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1003.001","name":"LSASS Memory","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1003/001/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0006","name":"Credential Access","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0006/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1112","name":"Modify Registry","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1112/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0005","name":"Defense Evasion","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0005/"}}],"false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、软件分发或安全工具"],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"endpoint","version":"*"},{"package":"windows","version":"*"},{"package":"m365_defender","version":"*"}],"investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","user.id","process.name","process.parent.name","process.executable","process.command_line","process.parent.executable","event.action","event.code","file.path","registry.path","source.ip","destination.ip","winlog.event_data.TargetUserName","message"]},"version":114,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now"}
